  "goodToKnow": "Das Völkerrecht is international law, the law between states (literally between peoples). Völkerrechtswidrig means in breach of international law: ein völkerrechtswidriger Angriffskrieg. Germany's Grundgesetz (Article 25) makes general rules of international law part of federal law. Germany also has its own Völkerstrafgesetzbuch, allowing prosecution of war crimes committed anywhere. It has no plural."
